  "security_implications": "This chunk instantiates integrity monitors for critical counters, FSMs, and register‑write onehot logic. Any violation directly asserts alert_tx_o[1], escalating to a hardware security alert. It also verifies at initiation that the KMAC enable masking strap matches the design parameter, preventing a misconfiguration that could leave key material unprotected. Omission or failure of these checks would allow silent control‑flow corruption or masking mismatches, leading to potential key leakage or unauthorized access.",
